# AI Manifest - Level 2: .github/ISSUES

## Purpose

This directory contains the detailed dependency-epic records referenced by the
paint-type dependency scheduler.

## Canonical Files

- `DEP-01-EPHAPAX.adoc` -- Ephapax dependency record
- `DEP-02-TYPED-WASM.adoc` -- typed-wasm dependency record
- `DEP-03-AFFINESCRIPT.adoc` -- AffineScript dependency record
- `DEP-04-GOSSAMER.adoc` -- Gossamer dependency record
- `DEP-09-STANDARDS.adoc` -- standards dependency record
- `DEP-10-PROVEN.adoc` -- proven dependency record

## Invariants

1. Each record must agree with `DEPENDENCY-SCHEDULER.adoc`.
2. Blocked dependencies must identify their external blocker.
3. Completed work must retain its verification evidence.
